---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: The upgrade from the last release
    accDescr: upgrade.sh asks GitHub for the last release of the app; without one, it skips the test with a notice. It downloads the package of the App Store and fails before Docker starts unless the signature matches the certificate of the app at the App Store and the provenance names build-release.yml. It installs the release into a fresh Nextcloud, sets it up with occ and searches; package.sh packs the checkout as krankerl packs a release, with the next version. The package replaces the release, and occ upgrade runs each repair step of the app once. The test passes when the settings page shows the same settings, the app keeps every key, the same search finds the same file with the stored token, which still goes to its own server alone, and the log of Nextcloud holds no finding; otherwise it fails with what the upgrade lost.

    latest{"A release?"}
    skipped["skipped with a notice"]
    download["the package of the App Store<br>of the last release, its signature<br>and its provenance"]
    verify{"Both valid?"}
    refused["fails before Docker starts"]
    release["the release in custom_apps<br>of a fresh Nextcloud,<br>occ paperless_unified_search:setup<br>and a search"]
    package["package.sh: the checkout<br>as krankerl packs a release,<br>with the next version"]
    upgrade["the package in place of the release,<br>occ upgrade with each<br>repair step of the app once"]
    checks["the settings page, the keys,<br>the same search, the token<br>for another server, the log"]
    same{"All as before?"}
    passed["passes"]
    lost["fails with what<br>the upgrade lost"]

    latest -- "no" --> skipped
    latest -- "yes" --> download --> verify
    verify -- "no" --> refused
    verify -- "yes" --> release
    release --> upgrade
    package --> upgrade
    upgrade --> checks --> same
    same -- "yes" --> passed
    same -- "no" --> lost

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef yours fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef fail fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class download,release,upgrade,checks bot
    class package yours
    class skipped,passed done
    class refused,lost fail
